    "body": "~~HOLY BACKLOG~~ closes #20776\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\n`vim.lsp.buf.format()` documents `range` option as `(1,0)` indexing. however, it does not accept `-1` as eol.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nNormalize that boundary case before constructing the LSP request.",
